6,"text":"I've got some treasure I want to sell.","nextNodeIds":[722430103]},{"nodeId":722430103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1435,"speakerName":"Marjorie","textMapHash":2152708034,"text":"You want to sell treasure? That's quite a surprise.","nextNodeIds":[722430104]},{"nodeId":722430104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1435,"speakerName":"Marjorie","textMapHash":2057173370,"text":"I imagine that an adventurer as skilled as you must have some truly rare goods to sell.","nextNodeIds":[722430105]},{"nodeId":722430105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1435,"speakerName":"Marjorie","textMapHash":3077546642,"text":"Let me have a look.","nextNodeIds":[722430106]},{"nodeId":722430106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Black Screen","textMapHash":415005578,"text":"You tell Marjorie about the Dragonbone Orb.","nextNodeIds":[722430107]},{"nodeId":722430107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1435,"speakerName":"Marjorie","textMapHash":1039497258,"text":"Huh, isn't this what the bards called the \"Fretnaught Fruit\"?","nextNodeIds":[722430108]},{"nodeId":722430108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1435,"speakerName":"Marjorie","textMapHash":2908721738,"text":"To think that it really exists... So its real name is the Dragonbone Orb.","nextNodeIds":[722430109]},{"nodeId":722430109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1435,"speakerName":"Marjorie","textMapHash":180707794,"text":"If its effects are as you say, I'd be willing to pay 80,000 Mora and some specialty dishes for it.","nextNodeIds":[722430110]},{"nodeId":722430110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1435,"speakerName":"Marjorie","textMapHash":2899049242,"text":"Hmm... How does 80,000 Mora and 5 Moon Pies sound to you?","nextNodeIds":[722430111,722430114,722430120]},{"nodeId":722430111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":158065106,"text":"...What will you use it for?","nextNodeIds":[722430112]},{"nodeId":722430112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1435,"speakerName":"Marjorie","textMapHash":534184226,"text":"Hehe. I mean, it's such a unique treasure.","nextNodeIds":[722430113]},{"nodeId":722430113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1435,"speakerName":"Marjorie","textMapHash":3533945154,"text":"Why, it has abilities straight out of a fairy tale! I doubt those alchemists would be loath to part with their Mora.","nextNodeIds":[722430110]},{"nodeId":722430114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":4070974762,"text":"A fair price. Done.","nextNodeIds":[722430115]},{"nodeId":722430115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1435,"speakerName":"Marjorie","textMapHash":2890202890,"text":"I'll take this, then. Thanks for your patronage!","nextNodeIds":[722430116]},{"nodeId":722430116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1435,"speakerName":"Marjorie","textMapHash":2311487042,"text":"Ah yes. Such beads formed from condensation tend to evaporate slowly in the wind.","nextNodeIds":[722430117]},{"nodeId":722430117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1435,"speakerName":"Marjorie","textMapHash":876689434,"text":"As such, it might be best to cover it with a diaphragm or place it within a sealed container to ensure its quality.","nextNodeIds":[722430118]},{"nodeId":722430118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1435,"speakerName":"Marjorie","textMapHash":1857549418,"text":"I'll give you this tip free of charge. Hopefully, it'll be of some use to you in your adventures.","nextNodeIds":[722430119]},{"nodeId":722430119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1435,"speakerName":"Marjorie","textMapHash":3770405338,"text":"If you encounter such treasures in the future, always remember that you'll have a loyal buyer in me!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":722430120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":4011870658,"text":"Let me think about it a bit more.","nextNodeIds":[722430121]},{"nodeI